(7704718, 1265287, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness!  My heart leaped with joy when I saw this!  How could anything be more delightful!  I think I might have cloned out the post on the right just to have there be no distractions from the leaves and the radiant child.  I don''t vote in this challenge because I have a personal rule not to vote on challenges I''m in, but this one would certainly get one of my highest marks!</td>', 'Ohmygoodness!  My heart leaped with joy when I saw this!  How could anything be more delightful!  I think I might have cloned out the post on the right just to have there be no distractions from the leaves and the radiant child.  I don''t vote in this challenge because I have a personal rule not to vote on challenges I''m in, but this one would certainly get one of my highest marks!', '2021-10-27 02:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7704719, 1265281, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful!  I love the leading lines that take you thru that gorgeous autumn to the building.  It''s perfection.  I''m not voting now, but wanted to comment on ones that pop up that are clear standout favorites.</td>', 'This is so beautiful!  I love the leading lines that take you thru that gorgeous autumn to the building.  It''s perfection.  I''m not voting now, but wanted to comment on ones that pop up that are clear standout favorites.', '2021-10-27 02:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
