(7704724, 1265170, 24454, '<td valign="top">So... you know I don''t vote on challenges I''ve entered... but having browsed thru most of the images now, I can say this is a standout photo and in my opinion deserves top honors from what I''ve seen so far.  That low hanging fog... the leading lines curving around that shimmering river.  The exquisite Oregon trees and color... I knew this would do well when you showed it to me before the challenge... and I''m seriously expecting a winner here.  GOOD LUCK, FRIEND!!!  This is AMAZING!</td>', 'So... you know I don''t vote on challenges I''ve entered... but having browsed thru most of the images now, I can say this is a standout photo and in my opinion deserves top honors from what I''ve seen so far.  That low hanging fog... the leading lines curving around that shimmering river.  The exquisite Oregon trees and color... I knew this would do well when you showed it to me before the challenge... and I''m seriously expecting a winner here.  GOOD LUCK, FRIEND!!!  This is AMAZING!', '2021-10-27 03:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
