(7705047, 1265179, 59737, '<td valign="top">Exactly what the challenge called for, lots of what appears to be sensor dust in the sky that could be cloned out.  Nice balanced exposure between the sky and the trees/river.  Think I would crop out the top quarter of the sky and bottom of the image.</td>', 'Exactly what the challenge called for, lots of what appears to be sensor dust in the sky that could be cloned out.  Nice balanced exposure between the sky and the trees/river.  Think I would crop out the top quarter of the sky and bottom of the image.', '2021-10-29 18:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
