(7705106, 1265174, 38162, '<td valign="top">Snoqualmie in WA. Or is that the indigenous spelling. Nice composition and editing restraint here. GL.</td>', 'Snoqualmie in WA. Or is that the indigenous spelling. Nice composition and editing restraint here. GL.', '2021-10-30 14:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705110, 1265236, 59737, '<td valign="top">veins and arteries in the lungs or heart, looks almost medical to me and where most of the photos are scenery this is a change of pace</td>', 'veins and arteries in the lungs or heart, looks almost medical to me and where most of the photos are scenery this is a change of pace', '2021-10-30 15:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705111, 1265313, 59737, '<td valign="top">nice change of pace in this challenge</td>', 'nice change of pace in this challenge', '2021-10-30 15:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705131, 1264954, 67258, '<td valign="top">I rather like your unconventional framing - It gives the viewer the chance to explore the image, although that said it may not work well for speed voters.  The toning works well here.  For this challenge, I do wish that the leaves had a little more prominence and that it didn''t appear as though a sapling was growing out of your model''s hand, nonetheless, a lovely image.</td>', 'I rather like your unconventional framing - It gives the viewer the chance to explore the image, although that said it may not work well for speed voters.  The toning works well here.  For this challenge, I do wish that the leaves had a little more prominence and that it didn''t appear as though a sapling was growing out of your model''s hand, nonetheless, a lovely image.', '2021-10-31 06:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705132, 1265325, 67258, '<td valign="top">Sums up today perfectly! A ''found'' image - a record shot - that perfectly illustrates the dismal, wet autumn day and suggests the miserable dark days of winter that will follow.  (It''s absolutely p***ing it down here...)</td>', 'Sums up today perfectly! A ''found'' image - a record shot - that perfectly illustrates the dismal, wet autumn day and suggests the miserable dark days of winter that will follow.  (It''s absolutely p***ing it down here...)', '2021-10-31 06:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705133, 1265191, 67258, '<td valign="top">An interesting flower and you have captured the striations and ruffles.  The foliage is very much incidental to the flowe, and as such the photo is at a distinct disadvantage in this challenge.  I would urge you to explore different framings - get down low, level with the flower, shoot upwards, across, try with more of the environment included in the frame.</td>', 'An interesting flower and you have captured the striations and ruffles.  The foliage is very much incidental to the flowe, and as such the photo is at a distinct disadvantage in this challenge.  I would urge you to explore different framings - get down low, level with the flower, shoot upwards, across, try with more of the environment included in the frame.', '2021-10-31 06:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705134, 1265009, 67258, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous rays, I particularly like the way they light up the grasses.  I am not so keen on the trees in the background - they seem to have been processed separately to the main image, with a confusing patch of mist and some disconnected grass heads - something just seems ''off'' a tad.</td>', 'Gorgeous rays, I particularly like the way they light up the grasses.  I am not so keen on the trees in the background - they seem to have been processed separately to the main image, with a confusing patch of mist and some disconnected grass heads - something just seems ''off'' a tad.', '2021-10-31 06:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705135, 1265311, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super capture of a heron, but the foliage in the foreground (identified by your title) seems completely incidental to the photo.</td>', 'Super capture of a heron, but the foliage in the foreground (identified by your title) seems completely incidental to the photo.', '2021-10-31 06:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705136, 1265170, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness, this is just lovely.  A beautiful composition (although the railway line does draw my eye out of the frame, so docking a point), lovely tonal range, delicately processed. 8</td>', 'Oh my goodness, this is just lovely.  A beautiful composition (although the railway line does draw my eye out of the frame, so docking a point), lovely tonal range, delicately processed. 8', '2021-10-31 06:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705137, 1265218, 67258, '<td valign="top">The perfect S composition, pleasing play of light and pretty good detail given the difficulties presented by the 700px limit.  A photo to be framed for your wall. 8</td>', 'The perfect S composition, pleasing play of light and pretty good detail given the difficulties presented by the 700px limit.  A photo to be framed for your wall. 8', '2021-10-31 06:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705138, 1265313, 67258, '<td valign="top">HA, very cute.  Unlike some other photos in the challenge, this very well photographed capybara (?) is completely relevant, with its interaction with the foliage.  Super work. 8.</td>', 'HA, very cute.  Unlike some other photos in the challenge, this very well photographed capybara (?) is completely relevant, with its interaction with the foliage.  Super work. 8.', '2021-10-31 06:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705139, 1265303, 67258, '<td valign="top">An interesting, graphical take on the subject. I like the way that you have separated the tree form its environment, focussing on shape and form.  I rather wish that there was less detail in the grass.</td>', 'An interesting, graphical take on the subject. I like the way that you have separated the tree form its environment, focussing on shape and form.  I rather wish that there was less detail in the grass.', '2021-10-31 06:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705140, 1265080, 67258, '<td valign="top">Cool idea - for me, the boots and foliage are a little too far away - might be worth retaking with the camera held closer to knee level.</td>', 'Cool idea - for me, the boots and foliage are a little too far away - might be worth retaking with the camera held closer to knee level.', '2021-10-31 06:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705141, 1265322, 67258, '<td valign="top">What super tree trunks!  For me that is what the photo is about - it would work just as well in mid winter as in late autumn as it appears here. Excellent control of what looks like a tricky exposure.</td>', 'What super tree trunks!  For me that is what the photo is about - it would work just as well in mid winter as in late autumn as it appears here. Excellent control of what looks like a tricky exposure.', '2021-10-31 06:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705142, 1265154, 67258, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but the wilted leaves don''t do a great deal for me visually.  My eye is repeatedly drawn to the bright patch in the upper right.  I suspect the a more visually appealing photo would have been a couple of weeks earlier when the bracken still held it''s spores.</td>', 'Interesting, but the wilted leaves don''t do a great deal for me visually.  My eye is repeatedly drawn to the bright patch in the upper right.  I suspect the a more visually appealing photo would have been a couple of weeks earlier when the bracken still held it''s spores.', '2021-10-31 06:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705143, 1265000, 67258, '<td valign="top">A pleasing depiction of a tranquil late summer day.</td>', 'A pleasing depiction of a tranquil late summer day.', '2021-10-31 06:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705144, 1265265, 67258, '<td valign="top">A super vista, with decent composition.  Certainly interesting to see a part of the world I have read of, but in terms of the photo itself, there doesn''t feel anywhere to rest my eyes.</td>', 'A super vista, with decent composition.  Certainly interesting to see a part of the world I have read of, but in terms of the photo itself, there doesn''t feel anywhere to rest my eyes.', '2021-10-31 06:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705145, 1265299, 67258, '<td valign="top">Interesting play of the manmade and the natural.  Foe me, the road is a little too prominent - I feel a tighter crop from the bottom would still keep that contrast, but would remove some of the tension - but then, that tension might be what you were aiming for. 7</td>', 'Interesting play of the manmade and the natural.  Foe me, the road is a little too prominent - I feel a tighter crop from the bottom would still keep that contrast, but would remove some of the tension - but then, that tension might be what you were aiming for. 7', '2021-10-31 06:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705146, 1265068, 67258, '<td valign="top">A pretty early autumn scene - detail is poor, but I suspect that is down to the 700px limit (I really struggled finding an image I could reduce the DPC size)</td>', 'A pretty early autumn scene - detail is poor, but I suspect that is down to the 700px limit (I really struggled finding an image I could reduce the DPC size)', '2021-10-31 06:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
