(7705358, 1265306, 67258, '<td valign="top">An impressive forest!  I rather wish the trunk on the left hand side wasn''t included in the frame.</td>', 'An impressive forest!  I rather wish the trunk on the left hand side wasn''t included in the frame.', '2021-11-02 13:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705359, 1265291, 67258, '<td valign="top">An aesthetically pleasing imageI do wonder if it would make for a slightly more comfortable view if it was flipped on the horizontal.</td>', 'An aesthetically pleasing imageI do wonder if it would make for a slightly more comfortable view if it was flipped on the horizontal.', '2021-11-02 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705360, 1265216, 67258, '<td valign="top">The foliage here seems completely incidental to the image as a whole.  It doesn''t really work for me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'The foliage here seems completely incidental to the image as a whole.  It doesn''t really work for me, I''m afraid.', '2021-11-02 13:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705361, 1265268, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely delicate image.  I really like the cyclist riding through the frame - I feel very much that I am the photographer walking behind.  The bright void troubles me, but only a tiny bit.</td>', 'Lovely delicate image.  I really like the cyclist riding through the frame - I feel very much that I am the photographer walking behind.  The bright void troubles me, but only a tiny bit.', '2021-11-02 13:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705362, 1265280, 67258, '<td valign="top">A lovely study.</td>', 'A lovely study.', '2021-11-02 13:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705363, 1265316, 67258, '<td valign="top">I feel this photo would work much better if you had taken it a couple of seconds earlier, with the pedestrians framed in the gap before the central trunk.  Otherwise, a pleasing image of this tropical looking garden.</td>', 'I feel this photo would work much better if you had taken it a couple of seconds earlier, with the pedestrians framed in the gap before the central trunk.  Otherwise, a pleasing image of this tropical looking garden.', '2021-11-02 13:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705364, 1265324, 67258, '<td valign="top">The autumnal reflections add a lovely touch and provide a base an interest to the foreground water.</td>', 'The autumnal reflections add a lovely touch and provide a base an interest to the foreground water.', '2021-11-02 13:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705365, 1265320, 67258, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this is Golfer?  The intermittent reflection/ultra clear water really mess with my brain, but for this challenge, and in this ''study'' type composition, works very well.</td>', 'I wonder if this is Golfer?  The intermittent reflection/ultra clear water really mess with my brain, but for this challenge, and in this ''study'' type composition, works very well.', '2021-11-02 13:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705366, 1265169, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a lovely scene - I see that you have framed the shot between the two evergreens, but I find the completely blurred foliage a bit of a distraction.  Nonetheless, a good entry.</td>', 'What a lovely scene - I see that you have framed the shot between the two evergreens, but I find the completely blurred foliage a bit of a distraction.  Nonetheless, a good entry.', '2021-11-02 13:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705367, 1265287, 67258, '<td valign="top">What fun!  From a purely aesthetic perspective, a different top with more muted colours would work better for me, and I would also consider cropping out the post/edge of building to the right of the frame.  Despite the child''s jumper shouting for my attention, a 7 for the sheer joy you have captured of the child playing in leaves.</td>', 'What fun!  From a purely aesthetic perspective, a different top with more muted colours would work better for me, and I would also consider cropping out the post/edge of building to the right of the frame.  Despite the child''s jumper shouting for my attention, a 7 for the sheer joy you have captured of the child playing in leaves.', '2021-11-02 13:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705368, 1265179, 67258, '<td valign="top">That is an impressive expanse!</td>', 'That is an impressive expanse!', '2021-11-02 13:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705369, 1265314, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a landscape you have found! This photo, though, does seem to have suffered with the 1200px/700kb limit - I''d love to see a larger version as I suspect it would have much more impact.</td>', 'What a landscape you have found! This photo, though, does seem to have suffered with the 1200px/700kb limit - I''d love to see a larger version as I suspect it would have much more impact.', '2021-11-02 13:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705370, 1265269, 67258, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this photo a couple of times before voting - ultimately it doesn''t really work for me, just not enough to hold my interest.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this photo a couple of times before voting - ultimately it doesn''t really work for me, just not enough to hold my interest.', '2021-11-02 13:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705371, 1265042, 67258, '<td valign="top">I would guess that this amount of green is unusual for the area, but may be way off mark.  The light on the rocks is fabulous, and that, for me, is where all the interest is - the bushes and foliage are, if anything, a bit of a distraction!</td>', 'I would guess that this amount of green is unusual for the area, but may be way off mark.  The light on the rocks is fabulous, and that, for me, is where all the interest is - the bushes and foliage are, if anything, a bit of a distraction!', '2021-11-02 13:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705372, 1265304, 67258, '<td valign="top">If this could be combined with one of the other river photos, you''d have a winner.  I love your composition, pleasing sky, and good range of colours in the trees.  The only negative - and it is quite crucial here, is the flat dull grey river that acts as a distraction to the main story.  If there were reflections of the autumnal colours, it would raise it up completely.</td>', 'If this could be combined with one of the other river photos, you''d have a winner.  I love your composition, pleasing sky, and good range of colours in the trees.  The only negative - and it is quite crucial here, is the flat dull grey river that acts as a distraction to the main story.  If there were reflections of the autumnal colours, it would raise it up completely.', '2021-11-02 13:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705373, 1265281, 67258, '<td valign="top">Another photo that seems to have suffered from the 700kb file size.  The colours are lovely.  I like that you use the S-bend to lead the viewer through the frame, but wonder if a slightly different viewpoint would prevent the house being obscured (or else completely obscuring it - I do find that my eyes fight to see behind the tree.</td>', 'Another photo that seems to have suffered from the 700kb file size.  The colours are lovely.  I like that you use the S-bend to lead the viewer through the frame, but wonder if a slightly different viewpoint would prevent the house being obscured (or else completely obscuring it - I do find that my eyes fight to see behind the tree.', '2021-11-02 13:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705374, 1265317, 67258, '<td valign="top">Wow, tha is some impressive work from your mum and dresser! Good work to the photographer for managing to merge so seemlessly the model completely in to the woodland.</td>', 'Wow, tha is some impressive work from your mum and dresser! Good work to the photographer for managing to merge so seemlessly the model completely in to the woodland.', '2021-11-02 13:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705375, 1265235, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing image.  Strong diagonal composition with plenty of interest all the way through the frame.  My only negative - and it is small - is the bit of orange foliage just in front of the green bush by the church; I might be inclined to clone it out as it very slightly upsets the balance. 7.</td>', 'Very pleasing image.  Strong diagonal composition with plenty of interest all the way through the frame.  My only negative - and it is small - is the bit of orange foliage just in front of the green bush by the church; I might be inclined to clone it out as it very slightly upsets the balance. 7.', '2021-11-02 13:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705376, 1264957, 67258, '<td valign="top">A good study in shape and colour - you have just missed the focus towards the bottom, which is a shame.</td>', 'A good study in shape and colour - you have just missed the focus towards the bottom, which is a shame.', '2021-11-02 13:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705377, 1265246, 67258, '<td valign="top">An interesting study - and good to see some imperfect leaves - but I do find the background a bit too harsh.</td>', 'An interesting study - and good to see some imperfect leaves - but I do find the background a bit too harsh.', '2021-11-02 13:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705378, 1265279, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like this quiet image a lot - very natural and unforced.</td>', 'I like this quiet image a lot - very natural and unforced.', '2021-11-02 13:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705379, 1265174, 67258, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lovely place to go for a walk.  I find the foreground just a bit too busy to make for a restful image.</td>', 'Looks like a lovely place to go for a walk.  I find the foreground just a bit too busy to make for a restful image.', '2021-11-02 13:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705380, 1264946, 67258, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a sight!  I am guessing this scene is quite hard to frame, but I do find myself wishing you had included a bit more of the height of the foreground trees.  I like the diagonals and triangles in the composition, not so keen on the upper left area of more barren land.</td>', 'Wow, what a sight!  I am guessing this scene is quite hard to frame, but I do find myself wishing you had included a bit more of the height of the foreground trees.  I like the diagonals and triangles in the composition, not so keen on the upper left area of more barren land.', '2021-11-02 13:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705381, 1265276, 67258, '<td valign="top">My last image, and this is the winner!  Wjhat a treat to end voting on :)The single scull in the distance anchors the lake from the rising mist.  That said, I think the photo would also work well without its inclusion. 9.</td>', 'My last image, and this is the winner!  Wjhat a treat to end voting on :)The single scull in the distance anchors the lake from the rising mist.  That said, I think the photo would also work well without its inclusion. 9.', '2021-11-02 13:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705382, 1265259, 67258, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the challenge that you have given the viewer with your different take on the topic, but for me, in this instance, the photo doesn''t really work.  It does speak to me a little of bleakness and impermanence, but the link is tenuous and the sense fleeting.  Hmm, now I have written all that, I shall have to raise my vote from 3 to 5.</td>', 'I appreciate the challenge that you have given the viewer with your different take on the topic, but for me, in this instance, the photo doesn''t really work.  It does speak to me a little of bleakness and impermanence, but the link is tenuous and the sense fleeting.  Hmm, now I have written all that, I shall have to raise my vote from 3 to 5.', '2021-11-02 14:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
